; Ozbound region data: the Yellow Brick Road, eastern stretch.
;
; A region is a level with no [guide]: scenery, resources, signs, houses and exits only (see
; bluebrook.map for the full format). Registered in assets/world/locations.world as
; YELLOW_BRICK_ROAD_EAST. The road runs west to east at y = 9, crosses a river on a wooden
; bridge (x = 21-23), and passes a waystation with a house, a garden, and two vineyard rows.
; Its west edge (x = 0, y = 9) is where the path joins Bluebrook's east edge in the overworld, so
; the road is walked straight on from the village; the east end is not open yet.

