[signs]
3 10 West: Bluebrook, the Munchkin village. The road is yellow here, and it is the only road worth trusting.
19 10 Bridge ahead. It is newly mended; the planks are honest, and so is the river beneath them.
45 10 The road runs on to the east, but the way is not open yet. The forest beyond keeps its own counsel.

